NOTICE

This product includes:

1. Chinese-language derivative works of the Herdr desktop app's shipped mods
   and frame screens (https://herdr.dev, Apache License 2.0):

   - mods/*-zh/ are Chinese translations of Herdr's shipped mods (files,
     machine-add, menu, pane, picker, toast, workspace-chrome,
     workspace-status, worktree), cloned at Herdr 0.1.16 and translated.
   - zh-patch/zh/*.js are Chinese translations of Herdr's shipped mod and
     frame sources (confirm, prompt, peek, help; frame settings, palette,
     welcome, whatsnew, feedback) at Herdr 0.1.16. Part of these
     translations was ported from yzj160212/herdr-zh (Apache License 2.0):
     https://github.com/yzj160212/herdr-zh
     Local additions: the settings and palette name maps include a
     "hanfang" -> "汉坊" display entry for this layout.
   - layouts/hanfang.json derives from Herdr's shipped main layout.

2. Bundled community mods, unmodified except where noted:

   - mods/better-sidebar, mods/better-tabs, mods/better-changes,
     mods/better-files, mods/branch-pr, mods/branch-issue from
     munza/herdr-mods (Apache License 2.0):
     https://github.com/munza/herdr-mods
     Shipped as the English originals; zh-mods-patch/dicts/*.json provide
     Chinese translations applied in place (dictionary-based string
     replacement) at install time.
   - mods/herdr-nvim, mods/herdr-nvim-header from ChmaraX/herdr-nvim
     (MIT License): https://github.com/ChmaraX/herdr-nvim
     herdr-nvim-header is locally modified to reference the pane-zh header
     mod instead of the shipped pane mod.

3. Third-party assets:

   - Icon SVGs (mods/workspace-chrome-zh/*.svg and other mod assets)
     originate from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC License, as shipped
     with Herdr.
   - themes/catppuccin.json follows the Catppuccin Mocha palette
     (https://catppuccin.com).

